The licence texts of the icon sets Symbols Nerd Font Mono carries, which
../README.md lists with each set's licence. Each file below is byte for byte
what the URL served, fetched 2026-10-11 and checked against the git blob the
GitHub API gives for the same path at the same tag. The path under this
directory is the path under src/glyphs/ at nerd-fonts v3.5.1 (tag commit
b894ea7803af6aade63d60a4381e006098ec9c4d), the release the font is from.

scripts/bundle-macos.sh copies this directory into the bundle beside the
font. baud-font/tests/licences.rs re-hashes every file against this list.

