  materialdesign/LICENSE puts the Material Design icons under Apache 2.0
  and names it by URL only, and upstream ships no copy of it beside them;
  Apache 2.0 section 4(a) wants the licence with each copy, so this is the
  SPDX licence list's text.

Weather Icons' OFL.txt is upstream's as served: its copyright lines are the
OFL's unfilled template. Five sets README.md lists as MIT -- Devicons,
extraglyphs (Hack), Font Awesome Extension, Seti and original, and Power
Symbols IEC -- have no licence file under src/glyphs/ at v3.5.1, so this
directory holds none for them. Font Logos is the Unlicense
(lukas-w/font-logos 1.3.0), which asks for no notice.
